@startuml RF6_Sequencia
title RF6 — Acessar e gerenciar o Perfil Lookbook\nDiagrama de sequência — abrir o Lookbook, abas Peças/Looks/Salvos, cards com HypeScore v2 e aba Insights
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4A4852
  LifeLineBorderColor #CBC6BE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F2EF
  ParticipantBorderColor #4A4852
}
autonumber
actor "Pessoa" as P
participant "lookbook/page.tsx\nu/[username]/page.tsx\nLookbookTabs" as FE
participant "lib/hype/use-hype.ts\n(lote + cache 5 min)" as UH
participant "ProfileController\nProfileService" as PC
participant "LookbookController" as LC
participant "LookbookService" as LS
participant "WardrobeController\nWardrobeService" as WC
participant "SocialService" as SO
participant "HypeController" as HC
participant "HypeQueryService" as HQ
database "MySQL" as DB

P -> FE: abre /lookbook
FE -> FE: RequireAuth → router.replace(/u/{username}?tab=)
FE -> PC: GET /api/profiles/{idOrUsername}
PC -> DB: users · follows (relação e bloqueio)
alt conta excluída ou o dono bloqueou quem vê
  PC --> FE: 404 Perfil
else perfil institucional
  PC --> FE: 200 {layout: INSTITUCIONAL}
  FE -> FE: router.replace(/brands/{slug})
else perfil pessoal
  PC --> FE: 200 {user, counters, relation, contentVisible, visibility}
end
opt ?tab=cupons|coupons e é o dono
  FE -> FE: CouponsRedirect → /coupons (a aba saiu do Lookbook)
end
FE -> LC: GET /api/users/{ownerId}/lookbook
LC -> LS: overview(viewer, ownerId)
LS -> DB: wardrobe_items e schemes do dono (sem ARCHIVED)
LS -> LS: visitante: Guard.canView (item × perfil) e só looks PUBLISHED
LS -> DB: saved_items (contagens) · daily_looks (today, só o dono)
LC --> FE: 200 {owner, self, visible, tabs[], emptyCloset, panelVersion,\ngroupingSuggestionsAvailable}
FE -> FE: abas Peças · Looks · Publicações · Favoritos · Agrupamentos\n(+ dono: Salvos · DNA · Look do dia · Cápsula · Insights)

== Peças (ordenar e filtrar pelo Hype) ==
FE -> WC: GET /api/users/{ownerId}/closet?category&state&sort&hypeLevel&page&size=24
WC -> DB: wardrobe_items + hype_scores (ordem/faixa)
note right of WC: dono = Hype pessoal; visitante = só Hype\npúblico (publicEligible); sem Hype = no fim
WC --> FE: 200 Page<PieceView>
FE -> FE: GET /api/pieces/seals?ids= (SealController: selos de marca na frente do card)

== Looks ==
FE -> PC: GET /api/profiles/{ownerId}?sort=recent|hype_desc|growth
PC -> PC: publishedLooks: LookbookService.rankable + hypeOrder
PC --> FE: 200 {schemes (até 60), sort}

== Publicações e Favoritos ==
FE -> LC: GET /api/users/{ownerId}/publications?page&size=24
LC -> LS: publications(viewer, ownerId, page, size)
LC --> FE: 200 Page {type: LOOK|PIECE, at, scheme|piece}
FE -> LC: GET /api/users/{ownerId}/favorites
LC --> FE: 200 {looks, pieces}

== Salvos (dono) ==
FE -> LC: GET /api/me/saved-looks?occasion&sort&page&size
LC -> LS: savedLooks(user, occasion, sort, page, size)
LS -> DB: schemes próprios + saved_items (SCHEME) + hype_scores
LC --> FE: 200 Page {origin PROPRIO|SALVO, scheme, favorite, canEdit}
FE -> LC: GET /api/me/saved-pieces?category&page&size
LC --> FE: 200 Page {piece, author, favorite, snapshot}
opt favoritar um look salvo
  FE -> LC: PUT /api/me/saved-looks/{schemeId}/favorite {favorite}
  LC -> LS: favorite(user, schemeId, favorite)
  alt look próprio
    LS -> LS: SchemeService.toggles (schemes.favorite)
  else look de terceiro
    LS -> SO: favoriteSaved(user, SCHEME, id, favorite)
    SO -> DB: UPDATE saved_items.favorite
    SO ->> SO: favorite = true → HypeSignal FAVORITE_CREATED (ver RF19)
  end
end
opt remover dos salvos
  FE -> LC: DELETE /api/me/saved-looks/{schemeId}
  alt não estava salvo
    LC --> FE: 404 Look salvo
  else
    LS -> SO: toggleSave(user, SCHEME, id) → DELETE saved_items
    LC --> FE: 200 {saved: false}
  end
end

== Cards de peça e look (FashionCard) ==
FE -> UH: useHypeSummary(PIECE|SCHEME, id) por card
UH -> HC: GET /api/hype/summaries?type=PIECE|SCHEME&ids=a,b… (até 100)
HC -> HQ: summaries(viewer, type, ids)
HQ -> DB: pieces/schemes visíveis + hype_scores (HYPE_V2)
HQ --> UH: 200 {items: id → {status, score, level, direction,\ndeltaPoints, momentum, dimensions, seals, stale}}
note right of UH: id fora da resposta = sem permissão ou\nsem cálculo → "não calculado", nunca 0
P -> FE: ↻ vira o card (HypeCardBack, mesmo cache)
opt "Ver análise completa" (HypeAnalyticsDrawer)
  FE -> HC: GET /api/hype/pieces|looks/{id}
  HC -> HQ: detail(viewer, type, id)
  alt item privado de terceiro
    HQ --> FE: 404
  else
    HQ --> FE: 200 {score, level, reasons, signals, weights,\nsealProgress, compatibility (DNA à parte)}
  end
  FE -> HC: GET /api/hype/pieces|looks/{id}/history?days=90
  HC -> HQ: history(...) → hype_score_snapshots
  FE -> HC: GET /api/hype/pieces|looks/{id}/positions
end

== Insights (dono) ==
FE -> FE: InsightStrip CLOSET → GET /api/insights?context=CLOSET
FE -> HC: GET /api/me/hype/wardrobe (HypeWardrobeInsights)
HC -> HQ: wardrobe(user)
HQ -> DB: peças e looks do dono + hype_scores
HC --> FE: 200 {averageHype, averageDeltaPoints, highlights\n(topPiece, biggestGrowth, classic, rare, forgotten,\ntopLook, mostRemixed), rediscoveries}
@enduml
